const POST = [["この伤害因","因此伤害"],["を不包含","不包含"],["当前は","当前"],["予定のHPを通用数值に是否乘算","预定消耗HP是否乘入通用数值"],["が穿透か","是否穿透"],["の上限","的上限"]];
const KEYS = Object.keys(G).sort((a, b) => b.length - a.length);

function substringTranslate(s) {
  let out = '', i = 0;
  while (i < s.length) {
    let matched = false;
    for (const k of KEYS) {
      if (k && s.startsWith(k, i)) { out += G[k]; i += k.length; matched = true; break; }
    }
    if (!matched) { out += s[i]; i += 1; }
  }
  for (const [a, b] of POST) out = out.split(a).join(b);
  return out;
}

// Process/passive/buff internal names: mostly grammar-free concatenated technical nouns, so the
// substring glossary alone gets these to fully readable Chinese in practice.
export function zhName(raw) { return raw ? substringTranslate(String(raw)) : raw; }

